{"time": 1757512490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477628085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#枫想起了当初让自己进入天文台的神......必须再次找到ta"}
