{"time": 1757512601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563488164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "不止为何，楼道内浮现出几个泡泡，它们一路向上飘着，似乎在指示着什么"}
{"time": 1757512643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106217513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#抓住最后的希望，跟着泡泡"}
